WEBVTT

00:06:58.715 --> 00:07:01.211
the eyes of seven generations,

00:07:01.235 --> 00:07:04.014
staring back at me, asking,

00:07:04.038 --> 00:07:05.948
"What did you do?"

00:07:06.995 --> 00:07:12.099
Now, we have millions
of children in the streets,

00:07:12.123 --> 00:07:15.806
asking us adults the same question,

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.287
"What are you doing?"

00:07:18.816 --> 00:07:20.605
And we have to respond.

00:07:21.073 --> 00:07:24.906
Like our fathers and mothers before us,

00:07:24.930 --> 00:07:28.423
we are the farmers of the future.

00:07:28.812 --> 00:07:31.804
I invite each of you to ask yourself: